*****************************************************************************/
Kinds
    DesignDocs      record the why, mostly for AI.
    documentation   records the what, Javadoc-like.
    describe        kant describes itself through describe.
One way in: lookup, with NO index.
    The lookup incantation sets its own search list over the description registries and lets kant resolve names.
    It defines nothing: a define with those registries searched risks capture (DE-6, Topics/forms "Waiting on Tony" 6).
    Three actions:
        lookup(name)        the first match
        lookupAll(name)     every match, part-name matches included
        lookupIn(request)   only in the named registry

